 ('ENT_SLAV_DOMOVOI','PER_SLAV_PAGAN','The tutelary house spirit of East-Slavic folk belief, dwelling behind the stove and protecting the household and its livestock if respected.'),
 ('ENT_SLAV_RUSALKA','PER_SLAV_PAGAN','A female water spirit, commonly the restless soul of a drowned or unbaptized woman, who haunts rivers and woods especially during Rusalka Week.'),
 ('ENT_SLAV_LESHY','PER_SLAV_PAGAN','The master spirit of the forest in East-Slavic belief, who guards the woodland and its animals and is known for leading travelers astray.'),
