 ('ENT_FINN_PEKKO','PER_FINN_TRADITIONAL','God of barley and the fields named in Agricola''s list (Pellon Pekko), invoked for the growth of grain and the making of beer.'),
 ('ENT_FINN_RAUNI','PER_FINN_TRADITIONAL','An obscure figure from Agricola''s list traditionally read as the consort of the thunder-god Ukko, associated with fertility and the harvest.'),
